<title>HONG KONG: ING Baring sets warrant on basket of Taiwan stocks.</title>
<headline>ING Baring sets warrant on basket of Taiwan stocks.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products Hong Kong Branch said on Friday it has launched 1.5 million American style U.S. dollar composite call warrants on a basket of five Taiwan stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p> National Securities Corporation		    10.5623 shares</p>
<p> Grand Cathay Securities Corporation		10.4114 shares</p>
<p> Yuanta Securities Corporation			 7.0076 shares</p>
<p> Capital Securities Corporation		     10.1693 shares</p>
<p> Fubon Securities Co Ltd				10.4114 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	US$90	    PREMIUM	   18.98 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 US$2.898	 GEARING	   3.45x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     LUXEMBOURG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    US$100</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
